        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) Proper Notice – means that the employee will notify both the Company and the Union by registered mail return receipt requested. Notice to the Company will be directed to the Human Resources Department. Notice to the Union will be directed to the Local Union Business Manager.",
